{
  "id": "paradox-rift-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Paradox Rift Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Paradox Rift prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 21–22 and 28–29 October 2023, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program from 20 October. Each box held four Paradox Rift booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Paradox Rift logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Iron Moth, Chi-Yu, Golisopod, Xatu, Espathra and Aegislash, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
